    "Scan a room to save its shape, details and photos. Add the rest of your house whenever you're ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan a room to save its shape, details and photos. Add the rest of your house whenever you're ready."
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escanea un cuarto para guardar su forma, sus detalles y sus fotos. Agrega el resto de tu casa cuando quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan each room once: as you move, a triangle mesh appears. **Green** means good photo coverage, including aligned earlier scans. **Red** needs more photos. Areas without triangles still need scanning. The white outlines are the walls, doors and windows being measured. **Photo detail** measures photography on surfaces already seen by LiDAR; it is not the percentage of the room scanned. Save and review for missing areas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan each room once: as you move, a triangle mesh appears. **Green** means good photo coverage, including aligned earlier scans. **Red** needs more photos. Areas without triangles still need scanning. The white outlines are the walls, doors and windows being measured. **Photo detail** measures photography on surfaces already seen by LiDAR; it is not the percentage of the room scanned. Save and review for missing areas."
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escanea cada cuarto una vez: al moverte, aparece una malla de triángulos. **Verde** significa buena cobertura de fotos, incluidos los escaneos anteriores alineados. **Rojo** necesita más fotos. Las zonas sin triángulos todavía hay que escanearlas. Los contornos blancos son las paredes, las puertas y las ventanas que se están midiendo. **Detalle de foto** mide la fotografía en superficies que el LiDAR ya vio; no es el porcentaje del cuarto escaneado. Guarda y revisa las zonas que faltan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
